### 4.2 FULL BACKUP (Level 0) - مکمل بیک اپ

#### Method 1: Simple Full Backup

```sql
-- یہ سب سے سادہ طریقہ ہے
-- RMAN Prompt میں یہ command چلائیں:

RMAN> BACKUP DATABASE;

-- Output شامل ہوگی:
Starting backup at 15-JAN-26 10:30:00
using target database control file instead of recovery catalog
allocated channel: ORA_DISK_1
channel ORA_DISK_1: SID=135 device type=DISK
...
Finished backup at 15-JAN-26 10:45:30
```

#### Method 2: Full Backup with Archive Logs

```sql
-- یہ آرکائیو لاگز بھی شامل کرتا ہے (بہتر طریقہ)

RMAN> BACKUP DATABASE PLUS ARCHIVELOG;

-- یا compressed بیک اپ (ڈسک سپیس بچاتا ہے):

RMAN> BACKUP AS COMPRESSED BACKUPSET DATABASE PLUS ARCHIVELOG;
```

#### Method 3: Full Backup with Configuration

```sql
-- پہلے RMAN کو configure کریں

RMAN> CONFIGURE BACKUP OPTIMIZATION ON;
RMAN> CONFIGURE CONTROLFILE AUTOBACKUP ON;
RMAN> CONFIGURE CONTROLFILE AUTOBACKUP FORMAT FOR DEVICE TYPE DISK 
      TO '/backup/autobackup/%F';
RMAN> CONFIGURE MAXSETSIZE TO UNLIMITED;
RMAN> CONFIGURE DEVICE TYPE DISK PARALLELIZATION LEVEL 4;

-- اب backup لیں
RMAN> RUN {
        ALLOCATE CHANNEL c1 TYPE DISK FORMAT '/backup/full/%d_%T_%s_%p';
        ALLOCATE CHANNEL c2 TYPE DISK FORMAT '/backup/full/%d_%T_%s_%p';
        ALLOCATE CHANNEL c3 TYPE DISK FORMAT '/backup/full/%d_%T_%s_%p';
        ALLOCATE CHANNEL c4 TYPE DISK FORMAT '/backup/full/%d_%T_%s_%p';
        
        BACKUP AS COMPRESSED BACKUPSET 
            DATABASE 
            PLUS ARCHIVELOG 
            DELETE INPUT;
        
        RELEASE CHANNEL c1;
        RELEASE CHANNEL c2;
        RELEASE CHANNEL c3;
        RELEASE CHANNEL c4;
      }
```

**اہم نکات:**
- `AS COMPRESSED BACKUPSET` = بیک اپ کو compress کرتا ہے (30-50% سائز کم)
- `DELETE INPUT` = پرانے archive logs کو حذف کرتا ہے
- `PARALLELIZATION LEVEL 4` = 4 متوازی streams میں کام کرتا ہے

