RMAN> CONFIGURE CONTROLFILE AUTOBACKUP FORMAT FOR DEVICE TYPE DISK 
      TO '/backup/autobackup/c-%d_%T_%s_%p.bkp';

-- 4. Backup Set کی زیادہ سے زیادہ سائز مقرر کریں
RMAN> CONFIGURE MAXSETSIZE TO 10G;

-- 5. Retention Policy (کتنی دیر backup رکھنی ہے)
-- REDUNDANCY: کتنے backups رکھنے ہیں
RMAN> CONFIGURE RETENTION POLICY TO RECOVERY WINDOW OF 7 DAYS;
-- یا
RMAN> CONFIGURE RETENTION POLICY TO REDUNDANCY 3;

-- 6. Parallel Processing چینلز
RMAN> CONFIGURE DEVICE TYPE DISK PARALLELIZATION LEVEL 4;

-- 7. Archive Log Deletion Policy
RMAN> CONFIGURE ARCHIVELOG DELETION POLICY TO APPLIED ON ALL STANDBY;
```

