## Part 7: Automated Backup Scheduling

### 7.1 Linux Cron Job (روزانہ بیک اپ)

```bash
# File: /home/oracle/backup_schedule.sh

#!/bin/bash

# Oracle environment variables سیٹ کریں
export ORACLE_HOME=/u01/app/oracle/product/26.0.0.0
export ORACLE_SID=ORCL
export PATH=$ORACLE_HOME/bin:$PATH

# Log file
LOG_FILE="/backup/logs/backup_$(date +%Y%m%d_%H%M%S).log"

# Backup command
{
    echo "Backup started at $(date)"
    
    # شنیچ کو full backup، باقی دن incremental
    DAY=$(date +%u)  # 1=Monday, 7=Sunday
    
    if [ "$DAY" -eq 1 ]; then
        # سوموار: Full Level 0 backup
        rman target / <<EOF
BACKUP INCREMENTAL LEVEL 0 DATABASE PLUS ARCHIVELOG;
EOF
    else
        # دوسری تاریخیں: Incremental Level 1
        rman target / <<EOF
BACKUP INCREMENTAL LEVEL 1 DATABASE PLUS ARCHIVELOG;
EOF
    fi
    
    echo "Backup completed at $(date)"
} >> $LOG_FILE 2>&1
```

### 7.2 Crontab Entry (خودکار چلائیں)

```bash
# File: /var/spool/cron/oracle (یا crontab -e)

# روزانہ 2 AM پر full/incremental backup
0 2 * * * /home/oracle/backup_schedule.sh

# ہفتہ میں 1 AM پر incremental backup
0 1 * * * /home/oracle/incremental_backup.sh

# ہر 6 گھنٹے میں archive log backup
0 */6 * * * rman target / <<'EOF'
BACKUP AS COMPRESSED BACKUPSET ARCHIVELOG ALL DELETE INPUT;
EOF

# ہر ہفتہ موجودہ backups کو verify کریں
0 3 * * 0 rman target / <<'EOF'
VALIDATE BACKUPSET ALL;
LIST BACKUP;
EOF
```

