## Part 8: Backup Best Practices & Maintenance

### 8.1 Backup Health Check Script

```sql
-- File: backup_health_check.sql

SET PAGESIZE 50
SET LINESIZE 120

-- 1. آخری backup کی تاریخ
SELECT 'Last Full Backup' as Backup_Type, 
       MAX(COMPLETION_TIME) as Last_Backup_Date
FROM V$BACKUP_DATAFILE
WHERE BACKUP_TYPE = 'L'
UNION ALL
SELECT 'Last Incremental',
       MAX(COMPLETION_TIME)
FROM V$BACKUP_DATAFILE
WHERE BACKUP_TYPE = 'I';

-- 2. Archive log status
SELECT COUNT(*) as Total_Archive_Logs,
       MIN(FIRST_TIME) as Oldest_Log,
       MAX(NEXT_TIME) as Newest_Log
FROM V$LOG_HISTORY;

-- 3. Backup validation status
SELECT COUNT(*) as Total_Backups,
       SUM(CASE WHEN STATUS='AVAILABLE' THEN 1 ELSE 0 END) as Available,
       SUM(CASE WHEN STATUS='UNAVAILABLE' THEN 1 ELSE 0 END) as Unavailable
FROM V$BACKUP;

-- 4. Disk space استعمال
SELECT * FROM V$BACKUP_DEVICE;
```

### 8.2 Monitoring Script

```bash
# File: monitor_backup.sh

#!/bin/bash

ORACLE_SID=ORCL
ORACLE_HOME=/u01/app/oracle/product/26.0.0.0
export ORACLE_SID ORACLE_HOME PATH=$ORACLE_HOME/bin:$PATH

# اگر 24 گھنٹے سے کوئی backup نہ ہو تو alert بھیجیں
LAST_BACKUP=$(sqlplus -s / as sysdba <<EOF
SET ECHO OFF LINESIZE 1000 PAGESIZE 0 FEEDBACK OFF VERIFY OFF HEADING OFF TRIMSPOOL ON
SELECT MAX(COMPLETION_TIME) FROM V\$BACKUP_DATAFILE;
EXIT;
EOF
)

HOURS_SINCE=$(($(date +%s) - $(date -d "$LAST_BACKUP" +%s))) 
HOURS_SINCE=$((HOURS_SINCE / 3600))

if [ $HOURS_SINCE -gt 24 ]; then
    echo "WARNING: No backup in last 24 hours!" | mail -s "Backup Alert" dba@company.com
    exit 1
fi

echo "Backup status: OK - Last backup was $HOURS_SINCE hours ago"
exit 0
```

